title: 'Fable vision: Heddle — the kernel Claude Code never had'
summary: 'Fable''s divergent pass (.paradigm/research/paradigm-8/07-fable-vision.md) offers three shapes: A Heddle (daemon kernel beneath Claude Code, recommended), B distro on deepseek-harness, C pure Claude Code Mods overlay. Recommends A: "Claude Code is the shell; we ship the kernel it never had: one ledger, one identity, one scheduler, and every session Warpline-native from birth." Four tensions with Arky recorded for founder ruling. P8-R2 (spec-driven fleet build) not yet covered.'
